[{"title":"孟夏一日瑞金署中晓望","author":"郭之奇","text":"一望苍然欲见春，飞花舞树动芳晨。\n莺声啼老蝉声细，始觉烟光已去人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35796,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三河舟晚","author":"郭之奇","text":"芳汀列树碧流分，界出家山断续云。\n万里征魂依曲岸，寻常估客步斜曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35797,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶阳登车念别亲友亦稀人事山行纵日欣感交心","author":"郭之奇","text":"眼见千山同是春，意中一壑转相亲。\n来云片片深行色，去涧淙淙落世尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35798,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪后杨荆岫见投近藁走笔代柬","author":"郭之奇","text":"窗前雪艳几徘徊，宝玉临门气欲来。\n古鼎敲云初见色，春风吹出绿光开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35799,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客司即事四首 其一","author":"郭之奇","text":"无辱无荣典客名，来王来享向人成。\n朝朝研墨磨朱卷，停笔槐阴听啭莺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35800,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客司即事四首 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"肘后诸方莫漫嗟，自从九折当医家。\n但随夔步含鸡舌，还守蜗居远鼠牙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35801,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客司即事四首 其三","author":"郭之奇","text":"终身于物共推移，大隐金门是我师。\n眼不皆青从世尔，玄如尚白欲谁欺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35802,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客司即事四首 其四","author":"郭之奇","text":"若道长安未若家，微官清况尽堪誇。\n凭他风雨迷天路，不入曹椽似水衙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35803,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄家中诸兄弟十首 其一","author":"郭之奇","text":"花时长忆弟兄群，绿岛春杯夜未分。\n一自梅风辞凤岭，于今柳雪滞鸿云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35804,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄家中诸兄弟十首 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"春草池塘梦得时，连床夜雨倍相思。\n阿奴碌碌真游倦，又负三三修褉期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35805,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄家中诸兄弟十首 其三","author":"郭之奇","text":"惭愧西园百树低，惜花人去鸟空啼。\n凭兄咫尺相巡问，莫遣红飞绿更迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35806,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄家中诸兄弟十首 其四","author":"郭之奇","text":"自北殷忧日夜移，向西言乐古今痴。\n看来世路同驹隙，何事秋风落雁期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35807,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄家中诸兄弟十首 其五","author":"郭之奇","text":"天伦乐事在诗书，未足三冬向五车。\n比似怡怡相对日，弟疑兄质莫群居。