{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35814,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见落花有感","author":"郭之奇","text":"每到春深念物华，可怜柔叶可怜花。\n一般红绿还相妒，解舞新条笑落葩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35815,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过邯郸口号六首 其一","author":"郭之奇","text":"世事浮云那足猜，名根浸骨去还来。\n邯郸莫用前时枕，几岁频从梦里回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35816,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过邯郸口号六首 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"漫道玄关不待人，潇然独善竟何邻。\n千言牛背传关尹，今古人心始谷神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35817,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过邯郸口号六首 其三","author":"郭之奇","text":"若使仙群少异才，云谣玉牒久尘埃。\n顽仙百辈名山卧，天地玄文何代开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35818,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过邯郸口号六首 其四","author":"郭之奇","text":"已知百岁苦无多，未解仙途数几何。\n一日人间真七世，便同元会亦飞梳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35819,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过邯郸口号六首 其五","author":"郭之奇","text":"今古终归必尽身，眼前为假便为真。\n乾坤别有黄粱境，祇恐神仙亦梦人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e